    <ns1:dokumenSumber>SRC_EXT_001</ns1:dokumenSumber>
    <ns1:identifierSumber>Section 2.2 Disease cycle, paragraph 1</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>When conditions are favourable, especially high humidity, multiplication of the pathogen increases around trichomes and penetration of the outer layer takes place (Daniel &amp; Boher, 1985a).</ns1:kutipanSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>When conditions are favourable, especially high humidity, multiplication of the pathogen increases around trichomes and penetration of the outer layer takes place (Daniel &amp; Boher, 1985a).</ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>
    <ns1:catatanKualitas xml:lang="id">confidence=high; review_status=verified; relation_type=direct</ns1:catatanKualitas>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Kelembapan tinggi pada Hawar daun bakteri; SRC_EXT_001.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
