  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#VarietasPanther">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="id">Varietas tanaman yang disebut pada sumber.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="id">Beberapa varietas kacang tanah di Balitkabi memiliki sifat tahan terhadap bercak daun yakni varietas Panther dan Domba, sedangkan yang agak tahan adalah Bison, Jerapah, Kelinci, dan Badak (Purnomo et al. 2004).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#Varietas"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <ns1:tahanTerhadap rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#PenyakitBercakDaunKacangTanah"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Panther</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:merupakanVarietasDari rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#KacangTanah"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="id">Panther</skos:prefLabel>
    <ns1:didukungOleh rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#BuktiVarietasKacangTanahSifatPantherDombaBisonJerapah"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#BuktiHujanLebatDanAnginKencangPadaPenyakitHawarDaunBakteriPadi">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#BuktiSumber"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Hujan lebat dan angin kencang pada Penyakit Hawar Daun Bakteri</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:dokumenSumber>SRC_EXT_018</ns1:dokumenSumber>
    <ns1:identifierSumber>BIOLOGY section, paragraph 1</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>Bacterial leaf blight occurs in both temperate and tropical rice-growing climate zones, with temperatures between 25°- 34°C and over 70% relative humidity. Conditions of strong wind and frequent, heavy rains (e.g., typhoons) are conducive for disease development (Mew et al., 1993).</ns1:kutipanSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>Bacterial leaf blight occurs in both temperate and tropical rice-growing climate zones, with temperatures between 25°- 34°C and over 70% relative humidity. Conditions of strong wind and frequent, heavy rains (e.g., typhoons) are conducive for disease development (Mew et al., 1993).</ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>
    <ns1:catatanKualitas xml:lang="id">confidence=high; review_status=verified; relation_type=direct</ns1:catatanKualitas>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Hujan lebat dan angin kencang pada Penyakit Hawar Daun Bakteri; SRC_EXT_018.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
