    <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Suhu 25–37°C pada Penyakit Layu Bakteri</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:dokumenSumber>SRC_EXT_026</ns1:dokumenSumber>
    <ns1:identifierSumber>Environmental conditions, paragraph 1</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>Bacterial wilt of potato is generally favoured by temperatures between 25°C and 37°C. It usually doesn't cause problems in areas where mean soil temperature is below 15°C.</ns1:kutipanSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>Bacterial wilt of potato is generally favoured by temperatures between 25°C and 37°C. It usually doesn't cause problems in areas where mean soil temperature is below 15°C.</ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>
