    <ns1:dokumenSumber>SRC_EXT_003</ns1:dokumenSumber>
    <ns1:identifierSumber>Conditions that Favor Disease, paragraph 1</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>Subsequent disease development is favored by high environmental moisture and moderate temperatures (64°to 81°F; 18° to 27°C), although infection can occur at temperatures outside of this range.</ns1:kutipanSumber>
