    <ns1:identifierSumber>Section 2.3 Ecology of the pathogen, paragraph 1</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>The optimal temperature for CBB development is 30 °C, whereas that for CBN is 25 °C (Maraite &amp; Perreaux, 1979).</ns1:kutipanSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>The optimal temperature for CBB development is 30 °C, whereas that for CBN is 25 °C (Maraite &amp; Perreaux, 1979).</ns1:kutipanNormalisasi>
